# Frontend Rules Index

Purpose: define Flutter technical standards for HOSSPI HMS (`frontend/`).

## Conflict order

1. Security, privacy, and safety rules
2. [`.cursor/api-contract.mdc`](../../.cursor/api-contract.mdc) for HTTP and cross-stack behavior
3. [`instant_ui_sync.mdc`](./instant_ui_sync.mdc) then
   [`realtime_sync.mdc`](./realtime_sync.mdc) for UI mutation and reconciliation behavior
4. This index and the owner file named below
5. Other frontend rule files
6. [`dev-plan/`](../dev-plan/) steps (chronology only)

